#: index.docbook:47
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "आमुख"

#: index.docbook:49
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &systemsettings; provides the user with a centralized and convenient "
"way to configure all of the settings for your desktop."
msgstr ""
"द &systemsettings; उपयोक्त्रे भवतः डेस्कटॉप् कृते सर्वाणि सेटिङ्ग्स् "
"विन्यस्तुं केन्द्रीकृतं सुलभं च मार्गं प्रदाति ।"

#: index.docbook:53
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&systemsettings; is made up of multiple modules. Each module is a separate "
"application, however the &systemsettings; organizes all of these "
"applications into a single location."
msgstr ""
"&प्रणालीसेटिंग्स्; बहुविधमॉड्यूलैः निर्मितम् अस्ति । प्रत्येकं मॉड्यूलः "
"पृथक् अनुप्रयोगः अस्ति तथापि &systemsettings; एतान् सर्वान् अनुप्रयोगान् "
"एकस्मिन् स्थाने व्यवस्थितं करोति ।"

#: index.docbook:58
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Each &systemsettings; module can be executed individually"
msgstr ""
"प्रत्येकं &systemsettings; module इत्येतत् व्यक्तिगतरूपेण निष्पादयितुं "
"शक्यते"

#: index.docbook:61
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"See section entitled <link linkend=\"run-modules-individually\">Running "
"individual &systemsettings; modules</link> for more information."
msgstr ""
"शीर्षकं खण्डं पश्यन्तु<link linkend=\"run-modules-individually\"> "
"व्यक्तिगतं &amp;systemsettings; मॉड्यूल</link> अधिकविवरणार्थं।"

#: index.docbook:67
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&systemsettings; groups all of the configuration modules into several "
"categories:"
msgstr "&प्रणालीसेटिंग्स्; विन्यासमॉड्यूलस्य सर्वान् अनेकवर्गेषु समूहयति:"

#: index.docbook:70
#. Tag: link
#, no-c-format
msgid "<link linkend=\"appearance\">Appearance</link>"
msgstr "<link linkend=\"appearance\">स्वरूपम्‌</link>"

